OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine dry day with the best of
OL,6,Fbright and sunny spells over southern
OL,7,Fdistricts and during the afternoon.
OL,8,FWinds light mainly north to northwest.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FStaying dry with clear spells
OL,11,Fand light and variable winds bringing
OL,12,Fthe risk of rural frost and fog
OL,13,Fpatches come dawn.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTuesday:FMist and fog quite extensive
OL,16,Fat first, gradually burning away
OL,17,Fleading to a fine, dry, sunny
OL,18,Fafternoon of light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
